  "cleanup": "Terminate and reap fresh simulator; never reuse eeprom; retain raw evidence",
  "rationale": "100 percent byte loss stops fresh GPS receiver input. GPS_TYPE2=0 prevents receiver substitution. GPS driver timeout4s; LAND within40s is an experimental bound for this EKF/configuration, not a documented universal guarantee. FS_DR_ENABLE0 isolates EKF behavior."
